msgid "SM Subscriptions"
msgstr "SM Subscriptions"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-subscriptions.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-subscriptions.php
msgid ""
"Plans of companies and professionals (limits on listings, tonnage, "
"buildings, service pages, completed projects, quotation answers, AI credits,"
" visible contacts, featured), AI credit packs and paid listing options. "
"Payment outside the site (transfer, CCP, BaridiMob, cheque) with proof of "
"payment, activated by the platform team, with an invoice. Founding members "
"offer. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"Formules des entreprises et des professionnels (limites d’annonces, de "
"tonnage, de bâtiments, de pages de services, de réalisations, de réponses "
"aux devis, de crédits IA, coordonnées visibles, mise en avant), packs de "
"crédits IA et options payantes d’annonce. Paiement hors du site (virement, "
"CCP, BaridiMob, chèque) avec preuve de paiement, activé par l’équipe de la "
"plateforme, avec facture. Offre membres fondateurs. Nécessite SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
